  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞美食广场……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞善和玲正坐在那里……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 29 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 15 01 0D 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 78 0D}你来了。\n那就开始那个叫作\n“以物易物对决”的比赛吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 8D 10}我去叫小熊他们过来。\n请稍等一下！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞等待相关人员到齐……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2D 11}那么，各位已经到齐，\n下面开始举行开幕仪式。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 15 01 02 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 86 29 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 0A 01 0F 01 03 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 87 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}善！\n小玲的骑士是小熊熊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 98 0D}不行。\n保护玲是我的职责。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 65 10}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}加油加油！\n善，不要输呀！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 11 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 49 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}小、小玲……\n这完全是小熊的客场熊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 22 01 01 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}双方唇枪舌剑，互不相让。\n真是一场令人期待的对决。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3F 11}那么，玲大人。\n请您公布这次的物品主题。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 0B 01 02 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2D 10}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}咦，我吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:10:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 0D 01 02 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 50 10}那就……甜的东西！\n不，还是咸的东西！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:10:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 03 01 02 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}嗯……能吃的东西！\n而且要超大份的！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 01 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 30 11}那么，{F2 01 03 01}“食物”“超大份”{F2 01 01 01}。\n这就是本次对决的主题。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0112",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0A 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 15 01 02 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 D1 0E}请两位收下这个。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞小熊和善从伊丽莎白手中\n　接过了一次性筷子。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 13 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}一次性筷子……？\n小熊有种不祥的预感……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}这是一场以物易物对决。\n请像《稻草富翁》的故事那样，\n从这双筷子开始，不断交换物品……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:15:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}最终目标是换到\n符合“食物”“超大份”的物品。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:15:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}另外，为了保证公平，\n与{F2 01 03 01}三个人{F2 01 01 01}交换完毕后，\n本次对决便宣告结束。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}也就是从这双筷子开始，\n和三个人交换物品吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 32 11}那么现在……\n“以物易物对决”正式开始！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 29 01 03 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 66 10}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}你们两个都要加油！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_018",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞以物易物对决拉开了帷幕！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 15 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 0A 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 90 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}说到吃的，当然要去摊位街！\n先下手为强！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:21:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞小熊飞奔而去……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:22:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 B7 0D}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:23:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}不用追上去吗？{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:23:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}美食广场更有机会{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:24:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 85 0D}嗯，留在这里就好。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:25:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_024",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 85 0D}嗯，我也这么认为。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:26:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_025",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}在同一个地方竞争，\n只会互相抢占机会吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:26:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_025",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}风花和乾就在那边。\n要不要先向他们打听一下？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_220.bf.json:27:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_026",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞和善一起逛逛美食广场，\n　向大家收集信息吧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
